      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/thread.ts",
      "summary": "The `opencode` TUI entrypoint command: spawns the TUI worker thread, bridges fetch and the global event stream over RPC to the worker, applies win32 console guards, and handles --prompt stdin piping, heap snapshots, network options, and session validation.",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "command", "worker", "rpc"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Uses a compile-time OPENCODE_WORKER_PATH define to locate the bundled worker, falling back to a dist or source URL; the RPC client re-implements fetch and SSE-style event subscription across the thread boundary."
    },
